HOLLOW STAR — PRIVACY POLICY

Hollow Star is a private Discord bot made exclusively for use within our server. This policy explains how information may be handled when you interact with the bot.

1. Data Collection Hollow Star may process basic information, such as Discord user IDs, server IDs, command inputs, and server settings, when necessary for its features to work.

2. Use of Data Any collected information is used only to operate the bot, maintain server settings, and prevent abuse within the server.

3. Data Sharing Hollow Star is intended for private server use. We do not sell personal information or share it unnecessarily with third parties.

4. Data Storage Some information may be stored to keep the bot's features working properly. Data handling depends on how the bot is configured.

5. Data Deletion If you have questions about stored information or want to request its deletion, contact the bot owner or server staff.

6. Third-Party Services Hollow Star operates through Discord and may depend on its services. Your use of Discord remains subject to 
Discord's Privacy Policy
.

7. Policy Changes This policy may be updated when the bot's features or data practices change. Updates will be shared within the server.

8. Contact For privacy-related questions, contact the server staff or bot owner.
